<div><p class="eyebrow">THE AUTUMN STAY EDIT · 2026</p><h1>A place<br>to <em>land.</em></h1><p class="intro">Two Toronto stays. Six new neighbourhood options for cafés, restaurants and quieter streets, alongside the downtown shortlist. Explore the approximate map, then compare the practical details.</p><div class="dates"><span>28 OCT – 9 NOV <b>12 nights</b></span><span>13 – 21 NOV <b>8 nights</b></span><span>1 ADULT <b>Prices in EUR</b></span></div></div>
<aside class="recommendation"><p class="eyebrow">NEIGHBOURHOOD FIRST</p><strong class="total">6 new stays</strong><p>West-end restaurants · east-end character</p><h2>Go out locally.<br>Come home quietly.</h2><p>Start with Little Portugal for the first stay and Good Vibes in Leslieville for the return. The latter has a workspace; the former needs a desk check. Both list in-unit laundry.</p><a href="#stay-map">Explore the neighbourhood map <span>↓</span></a><small>Conditional recommendation: late access must be confirmed.</small></aside>
