<p class="evidence"><span class="dot"></span><strong>Research snapshot · 18 October 2026.</strong> Seventeen apartment checkout totals checked for the dates shown and one adult. Prices and availability can change; these are not reservations. The excluded basement is an earlier search-only lead.</p>
