<section class="arrival-context" aria-labelledby="arrival-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ARRIVAL COMES FIRST · TORONTO LOCAL TIME</p><h2 id="arrival-heading">Landing late changes the shortlist.</h2><div class="flight-times"><p><strong>28 October · YYZ 22:05</strong><span>First stay · 12 nights</span></p><p><strong>13 November · YYZ 21:52</strong><span>Return stay · 8 nights</span></p></div><p>A 23:00 check-in cutoff is unsuitable for these arrivals without an explicitly confirmed later arrangement: immigration, baggage and the journey downtown still come after landing. Midnight is also a tight deadline if there are delays. A lockbox or 24/7 concierge does not override published house rules.</p><p><strong>No listing has verified unrestricted overnight arrival.</strong> Resolve late building access and key collection before paying. Landing times are the supplied itinerary times, not live flight status.</p></section>
