<div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEW / RESTAURANTS & NEIGHBOURHOOD LIFE</p><h2>A little further out.<br>A different kind of stay.</h2></div><p>Three first-stay options in the west.<br>Three return-stay options in the east.</p></div>
<p class="location-note">These choices prioritise local cafés, dining streets and residential character over walking to work. Descriptions of nearby restaurants come from the listings, not a guarantee of quiet or a rating of an entire neighbourhood. The downtown alternatives remain below.</p>
