<aside class="arrival"><strong>How I’d narrow these down</strong><p><b>Restaurant scene:</b> the Little Portugal garden apartment has the strongest mix of neighbourhood access and laundry, but no dedicated desk is listed and the main guest must be 30+. <b>Work setup:</b> Good Vibes and the church loft in Leslieville list workspaces. <b>Tradeoff:</b> Inn on the Park sits well for Ossington dining but has no washer or dryer. All six require late-access confirmation.</p></aside>
